{"id":"wb-6-807","name":"承天寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"承天寺塔","text":"承天寺塔，位于中华人民共和国银川市，因其位于银川市西部而被称作西塔。该塔是一座始建于西夏时期的砖塔，在清代乾隆年间被地震摧毁，嘉庆年间按原样重建。该塔共有11层，高64.5米，是宁夏境内现存最高的砖塔。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%89%BF%E5%A4%A9%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86856425,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856425","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d8ae39186e91c4f29a6c3182.jpg","title":"YinchuanWestPagoda.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:YinchuanWestPagoda.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/YinchuanWestPagoda.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Fanghong","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"West Pagoda, an ancient pagoda in Yinchuan, China","width":320,"height":240}}